2a9-c02059a383f9\", \"is_abstract\": false, \"is_monetary\": true, \"name\": \"Other Comprehensive Income (Loss), Net of Tax\", \"period_type\": \"duration\", \"qname\": \"rs-gaap:OtherComprehensiveIncomeLossNetOfTax\"}, {\"balance_type\": \"debit\", \"code\": \"rs-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation\", \"documentation\": \"Amount of noncash expense for share-based payment arrangement.\", \"element_type\": \"concept\", \"id\": \"94c13e49-1aff-502a-949f-16e08fe28dcd\", \"is_abstract\": false, \"is_monetary\": true, \"name\": \"Share-Based Payment Arrangement, Noncash Expense\", \"period_type\": \"duration\", \"qname\": \"rs-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation\"}, {\"balance_type\": \"credit\", \"code\": \"rs-gaap:StockholdersEquity\", \"documentation\": \"Amount of equity (deficit) attributable to parent. Excludes temporary equity and equity attributable to noncontrolling interest.\", \"element_type\": \"concept\", \"id\": \"e3796201-9899-5b7b-9477-659550ba8e68\", \"is_abstract\": false, \"is_monetary\": true, \"name\": \"Stockholders' Equity Attributable to Parent\", \"period_type\": \"instant\", \"qname\": \"rs-gaap:StockholdersEquity\"}, {\"balance_type\": \"debit\", \"code\": \"rs-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock\", \"documentation\": \"The cash inflow from the additional capital contribution to the entity.\", \"element_type\": \"concept\", \"id\": \"2eb72b5f-d7e3-5bd5-bf93-be38b6d21820\", \"is_abstract\": false, \"is_monetary\": true, \"name\": \"Proceeds from Issuance of Common Stock\", \"period_type\": \"duration\", \"qname\": \"rs-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock\"}], \"fact_set\": {\"entity_id\": \"entity_kg1a09d9856b5538c95a28\", \"factset_type\": \"report\", \"id\": \"fs_01M2ESJ338DH4S4QTQWVNTPE2Q\", \"period_end\": \"2026-08-31\", \"period_start\": \"2024-09-01\", \"provenance\": {\"arc_type\": null, \"mapping_id\": \"struct_01M2ESGT4CQPSD17HAYA7M8QJR\", \"origin\": \"pivot\", \"period\": \"2024-09-01/2026-08-31\", \"posting_filter\": null}, \"report_id\": \"